			old</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">erus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Poen. 4, 2, 80</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">5, 2, 27</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cervi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					8, 32, 50, § 116</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sexenni die,</span>”
				<i>after six years</i>, <i>an interval of six
					years</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Caes.
					B. C. 3, 20</span></i>
			.</div>
